    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BOEING 707-320\nSuper fan fel\nCITY OF MY\u003c\u003cNAK",
      "COCKTAILS FOR PURCHASE AT $ 1.00\nBourbon\nScotch\nGin\nGo-Getter Cocktail\nBrandy\nVodka\nGin \u0026 Vodka Martinis\nWelcome aboard Olympic's and Ozark's joint International Flair Service.\nLet me first tell you something about our airline, OLYMPIC AIRWAYS.\nThe Company was formed in 1957.\nThe new Company became responsible for\nall Greece's International and Domestic air services.\nimmediately\nprogram of modernization and expansion.\nwas converted to the most advanced jet aircraft.\nYear by year,\nnumber of planes was increased and the network of flights\ninitially within Europe and the Middle East.\nthe long haul routes with transatlantic flights to and from New york\nIn 1968, we started services to South\nand East Africa,\nwe extended our transatlantic flights\nto Montreal and Chicago.\nOLYMPIC introduced the Boeing 147-B\non our transatlantic service.\nour international network had expanded further, with the\nintroduction of our Australian routes linking\nAthens with Bangkok,\nand Sydney.\nActually, OLYMPIC AIRWAYS spans\ncontinents of Europe,\nour Company will not stop there.\nThere will be more new routes\nand new destinations added shortly to the world-wide network of\nOLYMPIC AIRWAYS.\nWe have established international sales affices and appointed\nrepresentatives in 95 cities throughout the world.\nOLYMPIC is also responsible for domestic services within Greece.\nin mention we\nnow have regular flights to more than 30 cities and islands.\nand representatives are spread throughout Greece; even in the smaller\ntowns and villages.\nOlympic Airways would like for you to take home this complimentary\nmenu as a memento of this International Flair Service flight ;\none of many to be featured by Ozark Air Lines.\nEAAHNIKH\nГАЛАТА\nGREEK SALAD\nconsisting of a mixture of greens,\ncurly endive,\nescarole, romaine\nand topped with anchovies, crumbled feta cheese, tomatoes, and olives.\nOil and Vinegar Dressing\nENTREE\nФІЛЛЕТО МПРІОЛА\nSteak Lucas\nChef's Sauce\nAAXANIKA\nVEGETABLES\nATKINAPEZ\nARTICHOKE HEARTS\nIn olive oil and dilled\nYAMAKI\nHARD ROLL\nPYZI\nWHITE RICE\nTopped with slivers of black\nolives and red sweet peppers\nBOYTYPO\nBUTTER\nКАФЕХ\nCOFFEE\nЕПІДОРПІО\nDESSERT\nМПАКЛАВА\nBAKLAVA\nFlaked Pastry with Honey filling\nANAYYKTIKA\nBEVERAGES\nTRAI\nTEA\nГАЛА\nMILK\nCOCA-COLA\nWINE"
    ],
